{"root":"bisul","ipa":"/bi.sul/","core":"皮肤上由于细菌感染而产生的疮、脓肿或疖子","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bi.sul/","zh":"疮，疖子","phrases":[{"t":"kena bisul","zh":"长疖子"},{"t":"bisul bernanah","zh":"化脓的疖子"},{"t":"mengobat bisul","zh":"治疗疮疖"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia tidak bisa duduk karena ada bisul di pantatnya.","zh":"他因为屁股上长了疖子而坐不稳。"},{"t":"Bisul itu sudah matang dan pecah kemarin.","zh":"那个疮已经熟了，昨天破了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bisul","ipa":"/bi.sul/","zh":"疖子，疮","phrase":{"t":"tumbuh bisul","zh":"长疮"},"example":{"t":"Anak itu sering menderita bisul.","zh":"那个孩子经常生疮。"}},{"w":"membisul","ipa":"/məm.bi.sul/","zh":"隐痛，像生疮一样作痛","phrase":{"t":"rasa membisul","zh":"隐隐作痛的感觉"},"example":{"t":"Lukanya mulai membisul dan meradang.","zh":"伤口开始隐痛并伴有发炎。"}},{"w":"kebisulan","ipa":"/kə.bi.sul.an/","zh":"多疮的，长满脓疮的","phrase":{"t":"badan kebisulan","zh":"全身长满疮"},"example":{"t":"Kondisi kebisulan itu membuat dia sangat menderita.","zh":"那种全身长疮的状态让他痛苦不堪。"}}],"derSlugs":["bisul","membisul","kebisulan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:03:16.801Z","src":"base"}